d risks.","temporal":[],"uncertainty":["The purpose statement does not expressly make proof of actual distraction a condition of the restriction."]},{"action":"Have regard to paragraph 3.11 when offering guaranteed returns or other incentives","actor":"Distributors","claim_id":"claim.fc4265d01b0eb16478bbccd8","conditions":["Offering guaranteed returns or other incentives in promoting SFC-authorised funds"],"evidence":[{"quote":"Even where the guaranteed returns offered would not constitute a “structured product” under the SFO, distributors are reminded to have regard to paragraph 3.11 of the Code of Conduct in offering such returns or other incentives in promoting SFC-authorised funds","unit_id":"db43e253bea18.u12.2646"}],"exceptions":[],"kind":"SCOPE","modality":"DESCRIPTIVE","readers":[{"local_id":"c6","role":"atomic-reader"}],"relevance":"CONTROL","statement":"Paragraph 3.11 remains relevant to promotional guaranteed returns and other incentives even where the guaranteed returns would not constitute a structured product under the SFO.","temporal":["When offering the returns or incentives in promoting funds"],"uncertainty":[]},{"action":"Classify guaranteed returns or other promotional incentives as gifts","actor":"Distributors offering returns or incentives","claim_id":"claim.ce8767c91ee82296e03de3af","conditions":["Returns or other incentives are offered in promoting SFC-authorised funds"],"evidence":[{"quote":"as they may be considered a gift that should not be offered to investors.","unit_id":"db43e253bea18.u12.2646"}],"exceptions":[],"kind":"SCOPE","modality":"UNCERTAIN","readers":[{"local_id":"c7","role":"atomic-reader"}],"relevance":"CONTROL","statement":"Such returns or incentives may be considered a gift that should not be offered to investors.","temporal":[],"uncertainty":["'May be considered' expresses possible classification, not permission or a determination that every incentive is a gift."]},{"action":"Offer additional returns or other incentives in 